{
  "name": "Shadowdance",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You gain the ability to step from one shadow into another. When you use your Cunning Action while in dim light or darkness, you can teleport up to 60 feet to a different unoccupied space you can see that is also in dim light or darkness. You can apply the effects of your Cunning Action before or after you teleport. This does not count as movement for the purpose of Cunning Action: Aim.</p>",
